      "cooked": "<p>I play every now and again. I went ahead and shot you a friend request. Most of my characters are lvl 25 and lower, only one is higher and she is level 40. Haven't played much since the revamp so some of my characters still need to get their powers in order again.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Being a lifetime subscriber is great, isn't it? By the way, even though it may be a little obvious my handle is RonwayX.</p>",
