      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/koga/{size}/2058_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-08T23:05:54.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I got my lifetime sub about 2 years ago when the game was in beta, when&nbsp;it was cheaper, just $200.&nbsp;I&nbsp;missed out on too many veteran rewards in City of Heros and wasn't gonna miss out again, plus I kept coming back to CoH again and again so I knew I'd be doing the same with CO and it would be worth it in the long run. I love games with great character customization.</p>",
